# Third-party notices

Breenix's root LICENSE covers Breenix material offered by its author. It does
not replace the licenses, copyright notices, or redistribution conditions of
third-party material listed here. In particular, the noncommercial restriction
does not apply to third-party components under their own licenses.

This inventory records the material present on 2026-10-25. Existing component
license files remain authoritative. Dependencies fetched by Cargo, the Rust
fork, SDK toolchains, QEMU and other external build tools are not vendored in
this tree; distributions containing them also need their respective notices.

