## Embedded dependency fonts

[noto-sans-mono-bitmap](https://github.com/phip1611/noto-sans-mono-bitmap)
is declared by the root, `kernel/`, `libs/libgfx-ref/`, `userspace/programs/`
and `tools/console-host-tests/` manifests with requirement `0.3`, by
`libs/libgfx/` with `0.3.2`, and by `scripts/metal/efi-stub/` with the exact
pin `=0.3.2`. The kernel graphics font and console are among its consumers.
The crate code is MIT, copyright (c) 2022 Philipp Schuster; [license text](licenses/noto-sans-mono-bitmap-MIT.txt) retained from
release 0.3.2. Its README identifies the rasterized Noto Sans Mono font as
OFL-1.1. [The Noto Sans Mono OFL notice](licenses/OFL-notosansmono.txt) is included
for the font family; the exact source-font version and copyright notice for
the dependency's raster data remain unresolved. This dependency is fetched at
build time, not stored as a vendor directory in this tree.

